<title>USA: IntelliGene, Ribozyme develop diagnostics.</title>
<headline>IntelliGene, Ribozyme develop diagnostics.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ribozyme Pharmaceuticals Inc said it granted IntelliGene Ltd a worldwide exclusive license to develop and sell diagnostics for several target diseases using ribozymes in amplified nucleic acid formats.</p>
<p>Under the pact, biotechnology company IntelliGene would develop diagnostic tests initially against six infectious diseases in their laboratories in Jerusalem and elsewhere, the companies said.</p>
<p>Ribozyme Pharmaceuticals would receive a license fee and royalties on product sales as part of this agreement, and might assist in the research efforts, it said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
